      "text": "句柄 → 整数 id。"
    },
    {
      "term": "ExternalTexture",
      "text": "可直接给 RenderEngine/HWC 用的纹理封装。"
    },
    {
      "term": "ResolvedComposerState",
      "text": "解析后的层状态，主线程只认它。"
    }
  ],
